# Poll the terminal/non-terminal state of this robot's most recent
# grasp/place request. Magic backends answer grasp/place synchronously
# and this service mirrors that last result so SimSpot can poll it the
# same way it polls a physics backend (task-11-brief.md).
string robot_name
---
string state      # idle | in_progress | succeeded | failed
string message
string object_id  # set when succeeded (grasp) / the released id (place)
